    "description": {
      "value": "This +1 striking returning spear is warm to the touch. The head of the spear is crafted from gold with ivory inlay and has a ruby set into the shaft. You can make the spear glow like a torch or suppress its light by using an action, which has the concentrate trait.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou touch the ruby and hurl the spear at a square within 40 feet. When the spear lands, it detonates, dealing 6d6 fire damage (DC 23 basic Reflex save) to all creatures in a 10-foot emanation. It then flies back to your hand."
    },
